(a) Every lobbyist, as defined in section 2-67, and who is required by the laws of the State of Georgia to be registered with the State Ethics Commission, shall also register with Fulton County. Registration with Fulton County shall be complete upon the filing of a copy of such person's registration filed with the State Ethics Commission, including each renewal of and supplement to same, with the Fulton County board of ethics. Each such registration, as well as each renewal of and supplement to such registration filed with the State Ethics Commissions, shall be filed with the board of ethics not more than three business days following the applicable deadline for filing same with the State Ethics Commission.
